        "text": "=⚠️ Overdue Invoice Follow-Up Triggered\n\nAn automatic payment reminder has been sent to a client with an overdue invoice.\n\n👤 Client: {{ $('If1').item.json['Client Name'] }}\n\n📧 Email: {{ $('If1').item.json['Email Address'] }}\n\n📋 Service: {{ $('If1').item.json['Service Description'] }}\n\n💰 Amount: {{ $('If1').item.json.Currency }}{{ $('If1').item.json.Amount }}\n\n📅 Due Date: {{ $('If1').item.json['Due Date'] }}\n\n🔔 Reminder Stage: Reminder 1\n\n📊 Payment Status: {{ $('If1').item.json['Payment Status'] }}\n\nPlease monitor this invoice closely. If no payment is received after Reminder 2, escalate directly to the business owner.",
