        "text": "=🚨 Escalation Required: Invoice Still Unpaid After Two Reminders\n\nA client has not responded to either payment reminder and requires immediate attention from the business owner.\n\n👤 Client: {{ $('If2').item.json['Client Name'] }}\n\n📧 Email: {{ $('If2').item.json['Email Address'] }}\n\n📋 Service: {{ $('If2').item.json['Service Description'] }}\n\n💰 Amount: {{ $('If2').item.json.Currency }}{{ $('If2').item.json.Amount }}\n\n📅 Due Date: {{ $('If2').item.json['Due Date'] }}\n\n🔔 Reminders Sent: 2nd\n\n📊 Payment Status: {{ $('If2').item.json['Payment Status'] }}\n\nBoth automated reminders have been exhausted. This invoice has been outstanding since [Due Date] with no payment or response received.\n\nPlease escalate directly and contact this client personally to resolve the outstanding payment before it affects the business relationship.",
