        "subject": "=Second Notice: Invoice {{ $json['Invoice ID'] }} Now Overdue",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json['Client Name'] }},\nI am following up again regarding invoice {{ $json['Invoice ID'] }} for \"{{ $json['Service Description'] }}\" in the amount of {{ $json.Currency }}{{ $json.Amount }}, which was due on {{ $json['Due Date'] }} and remains unpaid.\n\nWe have not received payment or a response to our previous reminder, and we would like to resolve this promptly..\n\nKindly process the payment immediately or reply to this email to discuss any concerns you may have. Continued delay may affect our ability to proceed with future work together.\n\nWe look forward to your prompt response.\n\nBest regards,\nJoshua T. Ikotun",
