        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json['Client Name'] }},\nI hope you are doing well.\n\nThis is a friendly reminder that invoice {{ $json['Invoice ID'] }} for \"{{ $json['Service Description'] }}\" amounting to {{ $json.Currency }}{{ $json.Amount }} was due on {{ $json['Due Date'] }} and is yet to be settled.\n\nIf you have already made the payment, please disregard this message and kindly send a confirmation so we can update our records.\n\nIf not, please process the payment at your earliest convenience.\n\nPlease do not hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns regarding this invoice.\n\nBest regards,\nJoshua T. Ikotun",
